{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd35 In a ruined future, two cities are linked by the \u201cSky Ladder\u201d \u2014<br>Above, the Neonlit City of Brilliance: dazzling yet deceptive.<br>Below, the Fallen Metropolis of Chenluo: decayed, but truthful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mikio Protocol, once maintaining the fragile balance, has failed. Class war looms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A prodigy girl, Iso Shikisai, awakens the long-silent AI \u201cMikio,\u201d aiming to restore a torn world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As her key ally, join the Agency to investigate urban rifts, accept faction missions, and uncover the buried truth.<br>Face Cthulhu-inspired horrors\u2014Bluebloods, Tentacled cults, and corrupted beliefs.<br>The fate of both realms lies in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanical aesthetics x Eastern myth, in a layered visual world.<br>Combat fuses modular \u201cMech-Weapons\u201d and character builds into fast, stylish freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world of lies, fractures, monsters\u2014and faith.<br>A journey of rebellion, connection, and redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887650/extras/b5682f31b8a0bb50cec9f4b65f823ef0.poster.avif?t=1758009195\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887650/extras/b5682f31b8a0bb50cec9f4b65f823ef0.webm?t=1758009195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887650/extras/b5682f31b8a0bb50cec9f4b65f823ef0.mp4?t=1758009195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Gameplay Features\u3011</strong><br>\ud83e\udde0 <i>Modular Mech Arsenal</i><br>Magrails, Pulseblades, Resonant Claws, Drones\u2014build your own tactical style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887650/extras/6bffa192038a19cd0ba953fc511e2986.poster.avif?t=1758009195\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887650/extras/6bffa192038a19cd0ba953fc511e2986.webm?t=1758009195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887650/extras/6bffa192038a19cd0ba953fc511e2986.mp4?t=1758009195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 <i>Core Roguelike Loop</i><br>Each run randomizes loadouts, attribute cores &amp; trait trees.<br>Evolve builds through \u201cEcho Fragments\u201d and tactical rewrites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887650/extras/84a3421128558f0cff1e78751785801d.poster.avif?t=1758009195\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887650/extras/84a3421128558f0cff1e78751785801d.webm?t=1758009195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887650/extras/84a3421128558f0cff1e78751785801d.mp4?t=1758009195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f <i>Faction-Driven Narrative</i><br>Join the Agency, take jobs from different tiers of society.<br>Your decisions shift the power of the Blueblood Hunters, Holy Gallop, and Divide-Walkers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887650/extras/ccc3fc27171f5c800de670f32bfa6d3f.poster.avif?t=1758009195\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887650/extras/ccc3fc27171f5c800de670f32bfa6d3f.webm?t=1758009195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887650/extras/ccc3fc27171f5c800de670f32bfa6d3f.mp4?t=1758009195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887650/extras/3bdd5716533f80b5c3f85274d39888d4.poster.avif?t=1758009195\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887650/extras/3bdd5716533f80b5c3f85274d39888d4.webm?t=1758009195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887650/extras/3bdd5716533f80b5c3f85274d39888d4.mp4?t=1758009195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc19 <i>Eldritch Horror Design</i><br>Face creatures from the \u201cRuin Domain\u201d\u2014Bluebloods, tentacle cults, godlike hiveminds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887650/extras/a6ec29c1dc7a63685496411631d30491.poster.avif?t=1758009195\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887650/extras/a6ec29c1dc7a63685496411631d30491.webm?t=1758009195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887650/extras/a6ec29c1dc7a63685496411631d30491.mp4?t=1758009195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <i>Signature Visual Aesthetic</i><br>Electric neon x spectral blue, industrial cyberpunk meets ukiyo-e ornamentation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887650/extras/89c98daf96badac305f568941e651d1c.poster.avif?t=1758009195\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887650/extras/89c98daf96badac305f568941e651d1c.webm?t=1758009195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887650/extras/89c98daf96badac305f568941e651d1c.mp4?t=1758009195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cCan truth survive a fractured world?\u201d<br>\u201cBeyond neon lies not light, but illusion.\u201d<br><strong>Neon Divide | \u65ad\u754c</strong><br><i>\u2014Divide is truth. Neon is the lie.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3887650?t=1758009195","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3887650?t=1758009195","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887650/35eefcde0b1d8cf29f4e7aac7dcc7f6602bcdf2e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758009195","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887650/35eefcde0b1d8cf29f4e7aac7dcc7f6602bcdf2e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758009195","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd35 In a ruined future, two cities are linked by the \u201cSky Ladder\u201d \u2014<br>Above, the Neonlit City of Brilliance: dazzling yet deceptive.<br>Below, the Fallen Metropolis of Chenluo: decayed, but truthful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mikio Protocol, once maintaining the fragile balance, has failed. Class war looms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A prodigy girl, Iso Shikisai, awakens the long-silent AI \u201cMikio,\u201d aiming to restore a torn world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As her key ally, join the Agency to investigate urban rifts, accept faction missions, and uncover the buried truth.<br>Face Cthulhu-inspired horrors\u2014Bluebloods, Tentacled cults, and corrupted beliefs.<br>The fate of both realms lies in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanical aesthetics x Eastern myth, in a layered visual world.<br>Combat fuses modular \u201cMech-Weapons\u201d and character builds into fast, stylish freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world of lies, fractures, monsters\u2014and faith.<br>A journey of rebellion, connection, and redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887650/extras/b5682f31b8a0bb50cec9f4b65f823ef0.poster.avif?t=1758009195\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887650/extras/b5682f31b8a0bb50cec9f4b65f823ef0.webm?t=1758009195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887650/extras/b5682f31b8a0bb50cec9f4b65f823ef0.mp4?t=1758009195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Gameplay Features\u3011</strong><br>\ud83e\udde0 <i>Modular Mech Arsenal</i><br>Magrails, Pulseblades, Resonant Claws, Drones\u2014build your own tactical style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://s